WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.263
This lesson does not assume you can use stairs, hear a siren, or see the picture.

00:00:05.263 --> 00:00:10.656
If you use a wheelchair, CDC says get away from windows and go to an interior room.

00:00:10.656 --> 00:00:14.424
If possible, get under a sturdy table and cover your head.

00:00:14.424 --> 00:00:19.622
If you cannot move and no one is there to help, cover with blankets and pillows.

00:00:19.622 --> 00:00:22.091
Plan extra help before severe weather.

00:00:22.091 --> 00:00:25.080
This app cannot promise that help will arrive.
